                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4355: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-10T22:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 10, 1922—10
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 10—8:15 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>212. Mandate issued this afternoon deprives Chang Tso-lin of all offices; another
                    mandate abolishes office of Inspector General of Manchuria.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
